    a: [['Namuna', 'I live in Chilanzar. In my neighbourhood there’s a big park, a supermarket and two schools. There are some small cafés too. There isn’t a cinema, but there’s one in the shopping centre near the metro. There’s a market on our street. It’s always crowded on Sundays.']],
    q: ['What is there in your neighbourhood?', 'Is there a park near your house?', 'Are there any good cafés in your town?', 'What isn’t there in your city? What do you want?']
