      x: '<p>Ular qanchalik tez-tez ekanini bildiradi. O‘rni: <b>asosiy fe’ldan oldin</b> (I <b>often</b> read), lekin <b>to be dan keyin</b> (She is <b>never</b> late) va yordamchi fe’ldan keyin (I can <b>never</b> wake up early). So‘roq va inkorda ham shu qoida: Do you <b>often</b> go…? I don’t <b>often</b>…</p><p>Boshqa vaqt iboralari: <b>every day, on Mondays, at weekends, in the morning, twice a week</b> — odatda gap oxirida.</p>',
